# The Infamous Cruelclaw, "Menace" and "deals combat damage to a player" (CR 702.110b, 510.2): one Memnite can't block it alone, and when
# Memnite and Ornithopter block it together its combat damage goes to them, not to a player, so nothing triggers: Bot2 stays at 20, nothing
# is exiled, the library is untouched. Cruelclaw (3/3) takes 1 and survives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
The Infamous Cruelclaw
Island
Swamp
Island
Plains
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Infamous Cruelclaw.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(The Infamous Cruelclaw > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Block(Memnite > The Infamous Cruelclaw)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > The Infamous Cruelclaw; Ornithopter > The Infamous Cruelclaw)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.AssignDamage(The Infamous Cruelclaw > Memnite: 1; The Infamous Cruelclaw > Ornithopter: 2)
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot2.Life = 20
? Exile.Count = 0
? Bot1.Library.Count = 7
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Memnite
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Infamous Cruelclaw.Toughness = 3
